# dist/ is committed so GitHub Pages (branch deploy) can serve the importmap
# targets while CI/Actions billing is unavailable. The Actions workflow in
# .github/workflows/pages.yml is the preferred path once billing is restored —
# at which point this committed dist/ can be dropped again. Track the built
# .js/.d.ts; skip the .map files (not needed to serve, and they bloat history).
# Rebuild + recommit dist/ on each release.
!/dist/**
/dist/**/*.map
